1. A blocked prompt (promptFeedback with no candidate) finishes as
   content_filter instead of ending with no terminal event. Upstream PR to be
   opened; remove when released.
2. The terminal event carries the candidate's finishReason as
   metadata.providerStopReason, so the service decides every finish reason
   from the SDK's FinishReason enum (apps/api/src/lib/chat/provider-stop-reasons.ts).
   Remove when upstream exposes the raw reason.

